{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "d31fb20b5bdd50ba67babb8d642d45d27950e7639700be8db1f4e2d6330991cb", "ja": "miracleなコラボレーション♪", "zh": "奇迹一般的合作♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5a225e03eb37c2d603bc904d1401fec3b95595d3a80560c3084e4f8aab94b29d", "ja": "音楽番組の企画で、高校のダンス部と\nコラボをすることになったミラソニの4人。\nコラボのことを伝えに、学校を訪問すると、\nアイドル達の登場に学生は大盛り上がり！\nダンスコラボの滑り出しは順調だ。", "zh": "在音乐节目的企划中，米拉索尼的4名成员将与高中舞蹈部合作。为了告知合作的事情，我们拜访了学校，偶像们一登场，学生们就欢呼了起来！舞蹈合作开了个好头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1000_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a7a522bf519ef36bc93c1a2811ab8c09defae7c5f14d8e8303c48c505612728f", "ja": "やってきました……『美楽留（みらくる）高校』！\nイエ～イ！", "zh": "我们来到了……“美楽留（みらくる）高中”！\n耶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "0be91ac4ce278dc141bdc270d5ad68f618709a6aa4e6bd4845b5e285e7b42265", "ja": "よその学校に来ると、なんかワクワクしてくるね！\nうう～、早く入りたい～！", "zh": "来到别人的学校，感觉整个人都兴奋起来了呢！\n唔唔～，好想快点进去啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "8a5e29e3b9730d7d13233f0741969c104c6f182e77f1e3df38cfdaf06f0fb4fa", "ja": "あははっ、その気持ちわかる～。でも！\n遊びに来たんじゃなくて、お仕事できたんだからね？", "zh": "啊哈哈，我懂你的心情～不过！\n我们可不是来玩的，而是来工作的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "9a1c8333627d5d45b77992b3652f3758aa43109b9d2b7888a13569332b1c2413", "ja": "そうそう！　ダーンスコラボ～、だよネ♪\nみんなで歌って踊って、サンバ・カーニバルだヨ～！", "zh": "对对！是舞蹈合作～对吧♪\n大家一起唱歌跳舞，来场桑巴狂欢吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "fb5b5b58629c5f1e9194118047727241f35e44987ee7ecf7a519a4ca833adff3", "ja": "それはちょっと違うんじゃないかな……？", "zh": "我觉得那有点不太对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b2037af699e2cc04dc41a6bf68628b29b024822e2407c32bd920b76c4605c81e", "ja": "事前にアタシ達とコラボしてくれる学校を募集したら、\nたっくさん応募がきたんだ。今回お邪魔するのは……。", "zh": "之前募集愿意和我们合作的学校时，收到了好多好多申请。这次我们要去的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "48cebe182daa456b1685828f14866b82a24429da6dd207f8a95c804faa4883c5", "ja": "ここ、美楽留高校ダンス部！　ダンスの取り組みが\nむちゃくちゃ熱い！って評判の学校！", "zh": "这里是美乐留高中的舞蹈部！这所学校可是以对舞蹈的投入特别热情而闻名的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "18c61ed36f749ab3a9b44f95e97a03a6812937edd991e93cff5bd7da467a43af", "ja": "えっと、ワタシ達が、ダンス部のみんなに\nコラボのことを伝えるんだよネ？　それじゃ早速～♪", "zh": "那个，我们要把合作的事告诉舞蹈部的大家，对吧？那就马上开始吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "678e075f4dc93c42f0abdd526f998204cb249cc7eb8a93478f9634afc03d43be", "ja": "わわっ！　待って、えれなん！　普通に伝えるだけじゃ\n面白くないから……ビックリさせちゃおうよ♪", "zh": "哇哇！等等，艾莲娜！光是普通地通知大家\n也太没意思了……我们来吓大家一跳吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "6b58605983bf67f87cbd220c0c62db79a61ff411aaa9d37c3ddf2a100e7c2700", "ja": "さっき、顧問の先生と話したけどさ。すごくノリの\nいい人だったよ。仕掛け人にもなってくれるって！", "zh": "刚才我和顾问老师聊了聊。她是个特别合得来的人，还说愿意帮我们一起策划呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8cdd7e7b7cd47a4bfdbf484a7209790c3815ce4e5855497a49cf392734e7fd33", "ja": "うんうん。こういうのは、最初が肝心だからね。\nアタシ達も、サプライズ成功させるよ～！", "zh": "嗯嗯。这种事一开始最重要了。我们也要让惊喜成功哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1011_komonnosennsei", "source_sha256": "7be7db9c6dcccf46cbafb5060ef8bb4d3c1298dfea8ec0e33018d56fd031f285", "ja": "はーい！　みんな、ちょっと集まってー！\n今日は、みんなに大事な報告があります。", "zh": "好——！大家稍微集合一下——！\n今天有件重要的事要向大家宣布。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1012_dannsubuinntati", "source_sha256": "1712c5412c92ff832823713ab457c418a130487598c527a2136a57061f2887f9", "ja": "ざわざわ……。", "zh": "窸窸窣窣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1013_komonnosennsei", "source_sha256": "12c8b995016cc10a7e7ea00d69051c7cb4ee563ba94038166617481d1700b0be", "ja": "詳しい話は……この方達に説明してもらいます！\nどうぞ、入ってくださーい！", "zh": "详细情况……就请这几位来说明吧！\n请进来——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "dda49d6e588a73d933e3dca9335dd541cb1bded481ba40c828796b456ee7ff79", "ja": "ダンス部のみなさんっ、こんにちはー！！", "zh": "舞蹈部的各位，大家好——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1015_dannsubuinntati", "source_sha256": "b427809045a8be9dfcfdb4a293750b4e094a1d804dc30656320342c11a51e7ac", "ja": "キャァァァァ！！！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "391a2f94aefa07d0e08c9ad44b35ee9d4e1737230bc3eb5ce9f0dfed042966d2", "ja": "へへっ、どーも！\n『miraclesonic★expassion』でーす！", "zh": "嘿嘿，多谢啦！\n我们是“miraclesonic★expassion”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1017_dannsubuinntati", "source_sha256": "b427809045a8be9dfcfdb4a293750b4e094a1d804dc30656320342c11a51e7ac", "ja": "キャァァァァ！！！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "525a88492a1dd8b2eaacb0862b92dd93030785a3b19c49adb9019053566ab203", "ja": "ワーオ！　みんな、元気いっぱいだネ！", "zh": "哇哦！大家都活力满满呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1019_dannsubuinntati", "source_sha256": "b27c61c8c20414215ee020456c46f42c49a0fc0c9cb6e6e176aae94bb496ef5b", "ja": "うそ、ミラソニ！？　本物！！？？\nみんなカワイイ！！　カッコイイ～！", "zh": "不会吧，是MiraSoni！？真人！！？？\n大家都好可爱！！好帅气～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "8a86a09b532f2bb1dee88d56ff68db71ba2d48a1bc5c1658e3465f7accbdf32a", "ja": "あはは、こっちはなんか照れくさいけど！", "zh": "啊哈哈，被这么夸还真有点不好意思呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "ccc7763e88dabb417885ec13f4bf43a54bd3e38003186fe8ceb22f131ef0102a", "ja": "先生の協力もあって、サプライズは大成功！\nみんな、とっても喜んでくれて、よかった～。", "zh": "多亏了制作人的协助，惊喜大获成功！\n大家都特别开心，真是太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "20e3739a82bc5429399b993a181905a114f09467373eb4bc18d5c36911bcbd61", "ja": "まあでも、喜びすぎて、ちょっと落ち着くまで\n時間はかかったけど……あはは。", "zh": "不过，大家也是高兴过头了，稍微花了点时间\n才冷静下来就是了……啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "1a6668c57f722b5ddd9684e5a025be0ee063110fa7e24442f1a4e2921cf2dda3", "ja": "今日は、ダンス部のみんなに会いにきたんだヨ。\nさて、ワタシ達がここに来た理由、わかる人ー？", "zh": "今天是来见舞蹈社大家的哦。\n那么，有人知道我们来这里的理由吗——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1024_dannsubuinntati", "source_sha256": "c511d34246374503f251e3d1e30a0f6e5408c53f783f26a7dff6c3f0ff0ee557", "ja": "はーい！　新メンバー探しー！", "zh": "好——！寻找新成员——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1025_dannsubuinntati", "source_sha256": "cfc8fc641afc52f2e5d547235eaaca57a3abb0637fade3fa14a7d0a9277c088e", "ja": "アハハハハ！！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈哈！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "97b4577947fa49e4b74cb6fba4c0065025b54e5801313116a7f2dc86c3119610", "ja": "それも面白そうだけど、今回はそうじゃなくて～。\nみんなにお願いがあって来たんだヨ～！", "zh": "那个听起来也很有意思，不过这次不是那回事～  \n我是有件事想拜托大家，所以才来的哟～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "62e048c4650eb47b3f50cee92ec33417359a0e4569426f1d8c7f7e4b7c50b1b0", "ja": "私達とみんなで一緒に踊って、すごいダンスの舞台を\n実現したいんだ！　……手伝ってくれますか？？", "zh": "我想和我们一起，和大家一起跳舞，实现一场精彩的舞台！……可以来帮忙吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1028_dannsubuinntati", "source_sha256": "bf707e18ee433dbc061ac0069df7c764dcbcc7452fbe51c7f54a2a4b3ef5490d", "ja": "はーーーい！", "zh": "好———的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "05271e107048b326f8652d3c1afc5938cd5f319db4fab6fac03488087f42ad70", "ja": "ありがとー！　じゃあ、早速だけど……\nまずは、自己紹介からしていこうか！", "zh": "谢谢啦——！那就马上开始吧……\n首先，先来做个自我介绍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "8d7c403a63e7fb06340625007e3e3487f07980619d80671de5349a292a194bb2", "ja": "こうして、ワタシ達のダンス企画がスタート！\nダンス部のみんなとは、もちろん初対面だったケド～。", "zh": "就这样，我们的舞蹈企划开始了！\n虽然和舞蹈部的大家当然都是第一次见面～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0400_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_01_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "79cf273a85939dcd06f57aa99d64894abf2e1e56bf763b86717c7d1b41861558", "ja": "元気で楽しい子ばっかり！\nワタシ達とも、すぐ仲良くなれちゃった。エヘヘ♪", "zh": "全都是些活泼又有趣的孩子！\n很快就和我们成为好朋友了。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
